textfont=museo_sans_11pt_regular
fontmono=no
text=You can select the mode to assign to items by clicking the radio button for items you wish to assign modes too. You can turn off items by selecting it twice, once to set it and the second time to unset it. The view information button will allow you to show more information on that current item without affecting the current mode, be aware that items and salvage have different modes.
